obtaining the first weight associated with the first reference picture based on the weight indication;
determining, based on the first weight associated with the first reference picture, a second weight associated with a second reference picture of the video block; and
applying the second weight to a second reference prediction sample associated with the second reference picture to generate a second weighted reference prediction sample, wherein the video block is decoded further based on the second weighted reference prediction sample.

